# ============================================================================
# PROVENANCE GATE — read HANDOFF.md §9 before editing this file.
#
# Zero ArenaNet bytes in this repo, ever. No client files, no Gw.dat, no
# extracted assets, no decompiled code. The repo contains OUR code and OUR
# observations. Everything derived regenerates from the owner's own legally
# purchased install via a documented extraction step.
#
# The capture vault is personal data recorded from the owner's own account.
# It stays local. It does not go in the repo and it does not go on the
# internet. This rule is why vault/ is the first entry below and why it was
# committed before any capture existed.
# ============================================================================

# --- The vault. Never commit. ------------------------------------------------
vault/
/vault/**
**/vault/
*.gwcap
*.gwcap.gz
captures/
!oracle/fixtures/index/

# Probe output. A listener standing in for an auth server receives whatever the
# client would have sent the real one — which can include account identifiers and
# credential material. Probe runs are observations, so they live in the vault; these
# rules exist so a stray run written to the wrong place still cannot be committed.
runs/
probes/
*.probe/
conn*.bin
events.jsonl

# --- ArenaNet client artifacts. Never commit, wherever they appear. ----------
*.dat
Gw.exe
Gw.dat
GwLoginClient.dll
gMod.dll
GW_Launcher.exe
GWToolbox.exe
*.ffna
*.mft
*.tpf

